    },
    {
      "description": "We had two rooms on the second floor.  Tom and Alex were in the room visible across the deck and the rest of us were in the room at the top of the stairs.  It was raining a lot.\n\nIt was around bed time and I was talking to the owner at the top of the stairs.  We were standing on a platform with a door to the outside deck.  After a few minutes the owner noticed water coming inside under the door.  We opened the door and saw that the deck had a few inches of water on it.  He took off his shoes and socks and waded to the drain and removed the leaves blocking it.  The water gushed down the drain and cleared the deck quickly.  Unfortunately the drain pipe has a vent hole on the first floor and the water boiled out and flooded their living room.",
